*> 01 entries with the CONSTANT clause of COBOL 2014: constants, like
*> level 78, which take no space; an integer one can size a picture.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CONSTANTS.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  NAME-SIZE           CONSTANT 8.
01  GREETING            CONSTANT IS GLOBAL AS "HELLO".
01  DOUBLED             CONSTANT AS (NAME-SIZE * 2) + 1.
01  CUSTOMER-NAME       PIC X(NAME-SIZE).
01  CODES               PIC 9(NAME-SIZE)V9(2).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY GREETING CUSTOMER-NAME CODES DOUBLED
    STOP RUN.
